        "Keep the pump clean and refill your watering can at the garden."
      ]
    },
    "child": {
      "name": "Nia",
      "role": "animal friend",
      "dialogue": [
        "Biscuit loves to play!",
        "Try feeding the animals their favorite food. You can play once per day."
      ]
    },
    "recycler": {
      "name": "Rumi",
      "role": "recycler",
      "dialogue": [
        "Even small things can have a second life.",
        "The recycling station is for learning; it does not create scored expedition resources."
      ]
    },
    "farmer": {
      "name": "Ari",
      "role": "farmer",
      "dialogue": [
        "Water crops once a day. A new day starts when you rest.",
        "Harvest ripe produce and trade it for animal supplies."
      ],
      "quest": "first_harvest"
    },
    "fisher": {
      "name": "Banyu",
      "role": "fisher",
      "dialogue": [
        "The river is full of life.",
        "Try fishing at the marked dock. One catch per day keeps the river healthy."
      ]
    },
